      "analytical_usefulness": 0.7,
      "source_groundedness": 0.93,
      "rationale": "Extracted salient keywords give a finer-grained lens beneath the category, useful for spotting recurring themes within kinds of issues. Somewhat redundant with issue_category and noisy/inconsistent, lowering leverage a bit, but still a distinct axis. Sampled keyword sets are well grounded in the source text (invoice/ach, sso/session, 502/outage, pin/competitor, csv/export)."
    }
  ],
  "analytical_usefulness": 0.9,
  "source_groundedness": 0.94,
  "rationale": "issue_category squarely serves the analytical query, offering the primary grouping needed to identify main issue kinds; issue_keywords adds a secondary, somewhat redundant but still useful thematic dimension. Both columns' values are soundly derivable from the source issue descriptions with no observed hallucinations across the samples."
}

